{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"善見律毗婆沙校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"一.是書校歴二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"二.譯校用巴利文本一切善見律釋對勘．校註略稱巴本。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"三.譯校凡有三例。（一）巴本文句歧異堪資尋討者．悉註出曰．巴本雲雲。（二）巴本","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"意義明顯可供參證者．悉註出曰．勘巴本意雲雲。（三）因勘巴本而見今文訛略","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"者．悉註出曰．勘巴本雲雲．今文雲雲。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"四.刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對勘北宋刻及麗刻改訂文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依某刻","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"雲雲。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"五.刊本款式今略改動以醒眉目．其例如下。（一）依本母頌句．畫分大段。（二）引頌","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"皆連長行排列．別註－＝於左．俾知此是頌句。（三）文中附釋皆低一格。（四）譯","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"家加註皆作單行小字旁列。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"六.校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"(一)．巴利文本一切善見律釋．Samantapa^sa^dika^na^mavinayat□t□hakatha^．錫","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"蘭刊本。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"（二）．本書南北宋刻及麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正藏大經","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_104_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_104","text":"本之校註。","sortOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}